  "description": "The timing couldn't be worse. So-Hui is pregnant, and her divorce from Ji-Hyeok is already in motion. She spent three years trying to earn his love before deciding that holding on was merely a selfish dream. Now, she must protect her unborn child from a marriage that was never meant to be. Or was it? As Ji-Hyeok faces the crushing void left by the divorce, his own family moves to sabotage his position at the company. Between corporate traps and a secret that could change everything, what is in store for this star-crossed couple?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
